{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13430","headline":"逢南中使寄岭外故人 · 常衮","name":"逢南中使寄岭外故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见说南来处，苍梧指桂林。\n过秋天更煖，边海日长阴。\n巴路缘云出，蛮乡入洞深。\n信回人自老，梦到月应沈。\n碧水通春色，青山寄远心。\n炎方难久客，爲尔一沾襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}